<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<chapter xml:id="ch12-change-of-variables" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Change of Variables in Multiple Integrals</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>The total derivative from Chapter 7 approximates a coordinate map by a linear transformation. The determinant from Chapter 3 measures the resulting local area or volume scale. We develop substitution formulas and then define pullbacks of area and volume forms explicitly, keeping nonnegative measure separate from signed orientation.</p>
  </introduction>

